{"id":"antrag","lemma":"Antrag","pos":"noun","rank":1903,"glosses":["application, request","motion, proposition, petition"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/De-Antrag.ogg/De-Antrag.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Antrages","plural":"Anträge"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich nehme diesen Antrag an.","en":"I accept this proposal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755630","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Bist du für diesen Antrag?","en":"Are you in favor of this motion?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Er machte mir plötzlich einen Antrag.","en":"All of a sudden, he proposed to me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Willst du mir einen Antrag machen?","en":"Are you trying to propose to me?","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Füllen Sie den Antrag aus!","en":"Fill out the application.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567047","words":[{"g":"to fill"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]}]}